# gbcli's starter font: the 95 printable ASCII characters, drawn by hand
# for gbcli, cell by cell, as this text. Capitals and digits stand 6 px
# tall on rows 0-5, lowercase 4 px on rows 2-5, and descenders reach
# row 7. Each glyph's last column is paper: the space between letters.

name: gbcli Starter

